<title>USA: SierraWest declares semi-annual div $0.16.</title>
<headline>SierraWest declares semi-annual div $0.16.</headline>
<dateline>TRUCKEE, Calif. 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>SierraWest Bancorp said Wednesday its board had declared a semi-annual dividend of $0.16 per share, payable March 25, to shareholders of record March 17.</p>
<p>On September 5 the company declared a dividend of $0.15 a share.</p>
